"over the main control connection using ``send_message()``."
msgstr ""
"원래 명령 문자열을 클라이언트 ID로 확장하고(예: ``/file mydoc.txt``는 ``/file mydoc.txt 42``가"
" 됨) ``send_message()``를 사용하여 기본 제어 연결을 통해 서버로 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:169
#: af07c5ef546a4102bbb836b65b2fd3be
msgid ""
"Obtain a local port for the outgoing file transfer socket by calling "
"``palloc()``."
msgstr "``palloc()``을 호출하여 나가는 파일 전송 소켓에 대한 로컬 포트를 얻습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:172
#: 37226a4f2e1e4a878ba325fca05df9bf
msgid ""
"Wait (up to 20 seconds) for the server to reply with a port number. The "
"server's reply (``/server_file_transfer_port <port> <client_id>``) is "
"received by the main connection and stored in ``file_server_port_list``. "
"When a matching entry is found, the port is extracted."
msgstr ""
"서버가 포트 번호로 응답할 때까지 기다립니다(최대 20초). 서버의 응답(``/server_file_transfer_port "
"<port> <client_id>``)은 기본 연결에서 수신되어 ``file_server_port_list``에 저장됩니다. "
"일치하는 항목이 발견되면 포트가 추출됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:180
#: e9cd68239fe3498597f07ccfa774ae22
msgid ""
"Call the low-level send function ``file_transfer_mode(filename, "
"server_host, server_port, client_port)``."
msgstr ""
"하위 수준 전송 함수 ``file_transfer_mode(filename, server_host, server_port, "
"client_port)``를 호출합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:184
#: 145c524c53654e84a0bb45d3a065733e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"For folder transfers, the worker function "
"``folder_file_transfer_client_recv_client_start(message)`` walks the "
"directory tree on the console thread. It first sends a ``/file_folder "
"<relative_path>`` command for the top-level folder itself to create the "
"corresponding directory on the server, then sends the same command for "
"every subdirectory it walks into. For each file, it starts a daemon "
"thread that holds ``file_semaphore`` around the actual transfer, with a "
"command of the form ``/file_folder <relative_path> <file_name>``, so the "
"number of concurrent file transfers is limited to ``max_thread_num``."
msgstr ""
"폴더 전송의 경우 작업자 함수 "
"``folder_file_transfer_client_recv_client_start(message)``는 디렉터리 트리를 "
"반복적으로 탐색합니다. 각 하위 디렉터리(최상위 수준 제외)에 대해 기본 연결을 통해 ``/file_folder "
"<relative_path>`` 명령을 보내 서버에 해당 디렉터리를 생성합니다. 각 파일에 대해 ``/file_folder "
"<relative_path> <file_name>`` 형식의 명령을 사용하여 "
"``file_transfer_client_recv_client_start_thread``를 호출합니다. "
"세마포어(``file_semaphore``)는 동시 파일 전송 수를 ``max_thread_num``으로 제한합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:199
#: 5a7d502137c8442eafae448cee95a72a
msgid ""
"``multiple_file_transfer_client_recv_client_start`` loops over the given "
"files and starts one worker thread per file, each holding "
"``file_semaphore`` around its own transfer, so the concurrent transfers "
"are capped by ``max_thread_num`` on that path too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:204
#: 4ae4777e086a48558cbe3dda0ecdb3fb
msgid "### Server-Side Handler (Receiving)"
msgstr "### 서버측 핸들러(수신)"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:206
#: 66a812ac1ac84ad2b912deb843f3c059
msgid ""
"When the server receives an extended command like ``/file mydoc.txt 42`` "
"on the main control connection, ``handle_command`` detects it and calls:"
msgstr ""
"서버가 주 제어 연결에서 ``/file mydoc.txt 42``와 같은 확장 명령을 수신하면 ``handle_command``가 "
"이를 감지하고 다음을 호출합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:211
#: 081e020d3e674d01bfde15c0922aa25c
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread(client_id, client_socket,"
" command)``"
msgstr ""
"``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread(client_id, client_socket,"
" 명령)``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:214
#: 4b5b5057002a457db83aed00c6148a7f
msgid "The server then:"
msgstr "그러면 서버는 다음을 수행합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:216
#: e2ad0e97b7854be4a3dded6cf7d602b7
msgid ""
"Creates a new thread via "
"``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start(client_id, client_socket, "
"command, new_save_path=None, file_name=None)``."
msgstr ""
"``file_transfer_server_recv_server_start(client_id, client_socket, "
"command, new_save_path=None, file_name=None)``을 통해 새 스레드를 생성합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:220
#: ee8cdc9ae93c4579a05e37b32c86f705
msgid "Allocates a transfer port with ``palloc()``."
msgstr "``palloc()``으로 전송 포트를 할당합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:221
#: ac8a87e1e481417284d90ba8cb843415
msgid ""
"Calls ``file_transfer_mode_recv(host, port, client_socket, client_id, "
"new_save_path, file_name, command)``."
msgstr ""
"``file_transfer_mode_recv(host, port, client_socket, client_id, "
"new_save_path, file_name, command)``를 호출합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:224
#: 2f6675b7698c41938542b09cbfb482e8
msgid ""
"This low-level receive function sets up a listening socket on the "
"allocated port, sends the port number back to the client (as "
"``/server_file_transfer_port <port> <client_id>``), accepts the client's "
"connection, and performs the protocol steps described in :ref:`file-"
"transfer-protocol`. The received file is saved under ``received_files/`` "
"(or a subdirectory if a folder transfer was requested)."
msgstr ""
"이 저수준 수신 함수는 할당된 포트에 청취 소켓을 설정하고, 포트 번호를 클라이언트에 다시 "
"보내고(``/server_file_transfer_port <port> <client_id>``로) 클라이언트의 연결을 수락하고 "
":ref:`file-transfer-protocol`에 설명된 프로토콜 단계를 수행합니다. 수신된 파일은 "
"``received_files/``(또는 폴더 전송이 요청된 경우 하위 디렉터리)에 저장됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:234
#: 9fe861572b8746aeaa8266d8d30f963f
msgid ""
"After the transfer completes (or fails), the port is released with "
"``pfree()``."
msgstr "전송이 완료(또는 실패)된 후 ``pfree()``를 사용하여 포트가 해제됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:241
#: 3e4e81fa8cea4ef5ab2a39602eb29355
msgid "Server-Initiated Transfer (Server → Client)"
msgstr "서버 시작 전송(서버 → 클라이언트)"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:243
#: 3ab21d4beefb41be83651eec10fd3899
msgid ""
"When the server administrator types a command in the server console, for "
"example ``/file /path/to/file.txt (127.0.0.1,54321)``, the console input "
"thread (``console_input``) parses the command and calls the appropriate "
"server-side file transfer API."
msgstr ""
"서버 관리자가 서버 콘솔에 명령(예: ``/file /path/to/file.txt (127.0.0.1,54321)``)을 입력하면"
" 콘솔 입력 스레드(``console_input``)가 명령을 구문 분석하고 적절한 서버측 파일 전송 API를 호출합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:251
#: fa019410dca84c04b24bf9334131aa8d
msgid "The recommended entry points for server-to-client transfers are:"
msgstr "서버-클라이언트 전송에 권장되는 진입점은 다음과 같습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:254
#: 99103b4e1f234e2dac2ffc955ab5b23e
msgid ""
"``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start_thread(message, "
"file_folder_abspath=None)`` for a single file."
msgstr ""
"단일 파일의 경우 ``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start_thread(message, "
"file_folder_abspath=None)``."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:257
#: a1560a9b45c043618778f38beb1c3cb2
msgid "``folder_file_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message)`` for a folder."
msgstr "폴더에 대한 ``folder_file_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message)``."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:259
#: c18cb827a52f48d6b2883b708e2c871e
msgid ""
"``multiple_file_multiple_client_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message)``"
" for multiple files to multiple clients."
msgstr ""
"여러 클라이언트에 대한 여러 파일의 경우 "
"``multiple_file_multiple_client_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message)``."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:261
#: 1b9fd8eea75e46899f68c6ca1312e896
msgid ""
"``diff_multiple_file_diff_multiple_client_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message)``"
" for different file lists to different clients."
msgstr ""
"``diff_multiple_file_diff_multiple_client_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message)``"
" 다른 파일 목록에 대해 다른 클라이언트로."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:264
#: d34ac75777c74fe4bc63e1a100fd2aa3
msgid ""
"The worker function ``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message, "
"file_folder_abspath=None)`` performs the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"작업자 함수 ``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start(message, "
"file_folder_abspath=None)``는 다음 단계를 수행합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:269
#: 29d03e172fd346e2a7928b55510df4f1
msgid ""
"Extract the target client address from the last part of the command "
"(e.g., ``(127.0.0.1,54321)``) using ``ast.literal_eval()``. Obtain the "
"client's socket from ``self.clients``."
msgstr ""
"``ast.literal_eval()``을 사용하여 명령의 마지막 부분(예: ``(127.0.0.1,54321)``)에서 대상 "
"클라이언트 주소를 추출합니다. ``self.clients``에서 클라이언트 소켓을 얻습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:274
#: 7a8d8ed423524d6e91a311a3aa3d5a9a
msgid ""
"Allocate a unique client ID and extend the command with it, then send the"
" extended command to the client over the main connection."
msgstr "고유한 클라이언트 ID를 할당하고 이를 사용하여 명령을 확장한 다음 기본 연결을 통해 확장된 명령을 클라이언트에 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:278
#: 94b6c1f8a6a240e4ba4be8cf20f87c7f
msgid "Allocate a local port with ``palloc()``."
msgstr "``palloc()``을 사용하여 로컬 포트를 할당합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:279
#: 723a05b6c3974b65a539af723f1e0872
msgid ""
"Wait for the client to reply with its own port number (via "
"``/server_file_transfer_port``), which is stored in "
"``file_server_port_list`` by the main connection's message handler."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트가 기본 연결의 메시지 핸들러에 의해 ``file_server_port_list``에 저장된 자체 포트 "
"번호(``/server_file_transfer_port``를 통해)로 응답할 때까지 기다립니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:284
#: 878572ca3d2948a9acbb6741f00ddd62
msgid ""
"Call ``file_transfer_mode(filename, client_host, client_port, "
"local_port)`` to send the file."
msgstr ""
"``file_transfer_mode(filename, client_host, client_port, local_port)``를 "
"호출하여 파일을 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:288
#: ca517571b2d34c0497fcf5d5b12c93a1
msgid ""
"On the client side, when it receives a command like ``/file "
"/path/to/file.txt (127.0.0.1,54321) 42``, ``handle_server_command`` calls"
" ``file_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread(client_id, "
"client_socket, command)``. This starts a receiver thread analogous to the"
" server's receiver for client-initiated transfers: it allocates a port, "
"replies with ``/server_file_transfer_port``, and calls "
"``file_transfer_mode_recv`` to receive and save the file."
msgstr ""
"클라이언트 측에서는 ``/file /path/to/file.txt (127.0.0.1,54321) 42``와 같은 명령을 받으면 "
"``handle_server_command``는 "
"``file_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread(client_id, client_socket,"
" command)``를 호출합니다. 이는 클라이언트가 시작한 전송을 위한 서버의 수신기와 유사한 수신기 스레드를 시작합니다. 포트를"
" 할당하고, ``/server_file_transfer_port``로 응답하고, ``file_transfer_mode_recv``를"
" 호출하여 파일을 수신하고 저장합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:304
#: cb7bdf5091e54e039de9d5578c273b93
msgid "Folder Transfer Mechanism (Detailed)"
msgstr "폴더 전송 메커니즘(상세)"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:306
#: b282df0b45bd4bb087ae10816fd3f06d
msgid ""
"Transferring a folder is implemented as a **recursive walk** that sends "
"separate commands for subdirectories and files. The logic is symmetric on"
" both client and server."
msgstr ""
"폴더 전송은 하위 디렉터리와 파일에 대해 별도의 명령을 보내는 **재귀적 탐색**으로 구현됩니다. 논리는 클라이언트와 서버 모두에서"
" 대칭입니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:312
#: fb34b1f5d8a4488b9aef8b71dcb764ec
msgid "### Creating Directories"
msgstr "### 디렉터리 만들기"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:314
#: 6b67f2390d914745a253523cef9a2e0b
msgid ""
"For a directory that needs to be created on the receiver side, the sender"
" sends a command of the form:"
msgstr "수신자 측에서 생성해야 하는 디렉터리의 경우 발신자는 다음 형식의 명령을 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:318
#: 7aaf85bf38fa4621a760dc56b6f99ad6
msgid "``/file_folder <relative_path>``"
msgstr "``/파일_폴더 <상대_경로>``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:320
#: 046f125a1f6e41e4808a9cd703e34ee4
msgid ""
"The receiver's handler for this command (in either "
"``file_folder_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread`` or "
"``file_folder_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread``) creates the "
"corresponding directory under the base receive directory "
"(``received_files/`` for the server, the same directory for the client). "
"The relative path uses forward slashes to be platform-independent."
msgstr ""
"이 명령에 대한 수신자의 "
"핸들러(``file_folder_transfer_server_recv_server_start_thread`` 또는 "
"``file_folder_transfer_client_recv_server_start_thread``)는 기본 수신 디렉터리(서버의"
" 경우 ``received_files/``, 클라이언트의 경우 동일한 디렉터리) 아래에 해당 디렉터리를 생성합니다. 상대 경로는 "
"슬래시를 사용하여 플랫폼 독립적입니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:331
#: 3fb5d6322ccd47f79e601e38684fe234
msgid "### Sending Files Inside a Folder"
msgstr "### 폴더 내에서 파일 보내기"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:333
#: c9f77546ed49407fa57c57f0b0a76acf
msgid "For each file, the sender sends a command of the form:"
msgstr "각 파일에 대해 보낸 사람은 다음 형식의 명령을 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:335
#: f5a164466b0d4d4382b7d880bd320e3d
msgid "``/file_folder <relative_path> <file_name>``"
msgstr "``/파일_폴더 <상대_경로> <파일_이름>``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:337
#: c507cca92d1c463ea9f4d429a38a9b6a
msgid ""
"The receiver treats this as a file transfer request. The second argument "
"(``file_name``) is used as the final filename, and the relative path "
"determines the subdirectory under the base receive directory. The actual "
"file data is transferred using the same single-file protocol (via "
"``file_transfer_client_recv_client_start`` or "
"``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start``, depending on direction)."
msgstr ""
"수신자는 이를 파일 전송 요청으로 처리합니다. 두 번째 인수(``file_name``)은 최종 파일 이름으로 사용되며 상대 경로는 "
"기본 수신 디렉터리 아래의 하위 디렉터리를 결정합니다. 실제 파일 데이터는 동일한 단일 파일 프로토콜을 사용하여 전송됩니다(방향에 "
"따라 ``file_transfer_client_recv_client_start`` 또는 "
"``file_transfer_server_recv_client_start``를 통해)."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:348
#: e1e2b8dd57524ecfabd47c2c8386dfea
msgid "### Concurrency Control for Folders"
msgstr "### 폴더 동시성 제어"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:350
#: 32b26f72bba4482490f38968dcee5837
msgid ""
"Because a folder can contain many files, the sender uses a semaphore "
"(``file_semaphore``) to limit the number of concurrently active file "
"transfers. The semaphore is acquired before starting each file transfer "
"and released in a ``finally`` block. The maximum concurrency is set by "
"``max_thread_num`` on the client and ``max_file_transfer_thread_num`` on "
"the server."
msgstr ""
"폴더에는 많은 파일이 포함될 수 있으므로 보낸 사람은 세마포어(``file_semaphore``)를 사용하여 동시에 활성화된 파일 "
"전송 수를 제한합니다. 세마포어는 각 파일 전송을 시작하기 전에 획득되어 ``finally`` 블록에서 해제됩니다. 최대 동시성은 "
"클라이언트의 ``max_thread_num``과 서버의 ``max_file_transfer_thread_num``으로 설정됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:363
#: 8ce424a7f1de4933b3113a0e3ab98155
msgid "Custom Destination Directory"
msgstr "사용자 정의 대상 디렉토리"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:365
#: 6ca8ee9f021842939f446e999c067dfb
msgid ""
"Every transfer family accepts an optional trailing "
"``destination_file_path`` argument that replaces the receiver's default "
"save directory (``received_files/`` or the configured "
"``file_transfer_dir``). When it is omitted, the transfer goes to the "
"default location exactly as before."
msgstr ""
"모든 전송 패밀리는 수신자의 기본 저장 디렉터리(``received_files/`` 또는 구성된 "
"``file_transfer_dir``)를 대체하는 선택적 후행 ``destination_file_path`` 인수를 허용합니다. "
"생략하면 이전과 동일하게 기본 위치로 전송됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:373
#: 6291da89ffa542dfbd94f599a9321216
msgid ""
"The destination is **always the last argument** of the command and names "
"a *directory* on the receiving machine: the received file keeps its own "
"name (``<destination>/<filename>``), and a transferred folder keeps its "
"structure under the destination (``<destination>/<folder_name>/...`` ). "
"An absolute path is used as-is; a relative path is resolved under the "
"default save directory. Missing directories are created."
msgstr ""
"대상은 **항상 명령의 마지막 인수**이며 수신 시스템의 *디렉토리* 이름을 지정합니다. 수신된 파일은 자체 "
"이름(``<destination>/<filename>``)을 유지하고 전송된 폴더는 "
"대상(``<destination>/<folder_name>/...``) 아래의 구조를 유지합니다. 절대 경로는 있는 그대로 "
"사용됩니다. 상대 경로는 기본 저장 디렉터리에서 확인됩니다. 누락된 디렉터리가 생성됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:385
#: 76243e0349c1474bbdf14e1ef2a8e52b
msgid "Command syntax:"
msgstr "명령 구문:"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:387
#: 0c055bfc5ba4465a98a3555f8aa124c3
msgid "Client console (the receiver is the server):"
msgstr "클라이언트 콘솔(수신자는 서버임):"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:389
#: c9fa612895bc4f92839d2de77b6cbc7f
msgid "``/file <file_path> [destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/파일 <파일_경로> [대상_파일_경로]``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:391
#: 2d34a030a1804d299a0b56c14984b1b5
msgid "``/multiple_file <file1> <file2> ... [destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/다중_파일 <파일1> <파일2> ... [대상_파일_경로]``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:393
#: a7dd1e241a4346d4b873072c5948f187
#, fuzzy
msgid "``/file_folder <folder_path> [destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/파일_폴더 <상대_경로>``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:395
#: 953993d920eb4959987d98423440ce61
msgid "``/multiple_file_folder <folder1> <folder2> ... [destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/다중_파일_폴더 <폴더1> <폴더2> ... [대상_파일_경로]``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:397
#: 886c8b7d760044cabe48ce044412ca64
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Server console (the receiver is the target client, given as a quoted "
"``(ip, port)`` address tuple, not as a client id):"
msgstr "서버 콘솔(수신자는 인용된 주소 튜플로 지정된 대상 클라이언트입니다):"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:401
#: 48d3bf6084224062867313a9597044d7
#, fuzzy
msgid "``/file <file_path> <(ip, port)> [destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/파일 <파일_경로> [대상_파일_경로]``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:403
#: 684fa9b22136418b94cbb4202f702cd2
#, fuzzy
msgid "``/file_folder <folder_path> <(ip, port)> [destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/파일_폴더 <상대_경로>``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:405
#: 9380dc31685947e3a835107f435deed2
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``/multiple_file_multiple_client <file1> <file2> ... <(ip, port)1> <(ip, "
"port)2> ... [destination_file_path]``"
msgstr ""
"``/multiple_file_multiple_client <file1> <file2> ... <client_id1> "
"<client_id2> ... [대상_파일_경로]``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:407
#: 62488b8bb4e149be86c1d655bd80b6a8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``/diff_multiple_file_diff_multiple_client <file1> ... <(ip, port)1> ... "
"[destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``diff_multiple_file_diff_multiple_client_transfer_server_recv_client_start``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:409
#: d6a0c51014c9403fb82ebdf5c93928bc
msgid ""
"For the multiple-item commands the destination is the last argument; when"
" the last argument is not a ``(ip, port)`` tuple it is treated as the "
"destination path (for the ``/multiple_file_multiple_client`` form, items "
"are classified per token, so files and addresses may be interleaved and a"
" last argument that is not an existing local file/folder is the "
"destination)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:419
#: 373c2a5a23334df7a25d23f8d94abd66
msgid "Native In-Memory Forwarding"
msgstr "네이티브 메모리 내 전달"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:421
#: dd57639b3e0e4068bd9533fc039597cd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The main protocol also provides a native, client-side forwarding feature "
"that relays data from one client to several other clients through the "
"server **without any disk I/O on the server**. Unlike the forward "
"extension (which uploads the data to the server's transfer directory "
"first and then has the server push the stored copies), the server only "
"holds the data in memory and streams it straight to the target clients. "
"This avoids the double transfer time and the disk read/write overhead."
msgstr ""
"기본 프로토콜은 또한 **서버의 디스크 I/O 없이** 서버를 통해 한 클라이언트에서 여러 다른 클라이언트로 데이터를 중계하는 기본"
" 클라이언트 측 전달 기능을 제공합니다. 디스크에 업로드한 다음 디스크에서 다운로드하는 순방향 확장과 달리 서버는 데이터를 "
"메모리에만 보유하고 대상 클라이언트로 직접 스트리밍합니다. 이렇게 하면 이중 전송 시간과 디스크 읽기/쓰기 오버헤드가 방지됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:433
#: 982c4c9538914821a07887fb8ab9b95d
#, fuzzy
msgid "Commands (client console only; rejected on the server console):"
msgstr "클라이언트 콘솔(수신자는 서버임):"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:436
#: 14406316555743359a854540ab6937c8
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``/forward_file <file1> <file2> ... <addr1> <addr2> ... "
"[destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/forward_file <파일1> <파일2> ... <addr1> <addr2> ...``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:437
#: 4dc576898177404da124649f7ce9ac28
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"``/forward_folder <folder1> <folder2> ... <addr1> <addr2> ... "
"[destination_file_path]``"
msgstr "``/forward_folder <폴더1> <폴더2> ... <addr1> <addr2> ...``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:439
#: 220dfbf0a0d84559a8befb4eee500ba0
msgid ""
"The number of files/folders and the number of target clients (written as "
"quoted address tuples) is unlimited. Target addresses that are "
"unreachable (not connected to the server) or equal to the server itself "
"are skipped and the remaining targets are still served."
msgstr ""
"파일/폴더 수와 대상 클라이언트 수(따옴표로 묶인 주소 튜플로 작성됨)는 무제한입니다. 연결할 수 없거나(서버에 연결되지 않음) "
"서버 자체와 동일한 대상 주소는 건너뛰고 나머지 대상은 계속 제공됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:447
#: 6137bf9406784c6f82d9f41560a52566
msgid ""
"Like every transfer family, both commands accept an optional trailing "
"``destination_file_path`` that replaces the default save directory on "
"every receiving client: a forwarded file lands at "
"``<destination>/<filename>`` and a forwarded folder keeps its structure "
"under ``<destination>/<folder_name>/...``. When the argument is omitted "
"the targets write to their default ``file_transfer_dir``."
msgstr ""
"모든 전송 패밀리와 마찬가지로 두 명령은 모든 수신 클라이언트의 기본 저장 디렉토리를 대체하는 선택적 후행 `` "
"destination_file_path '' 를 허용합니다. 전달된 파일은 ``<destination>/`<filename>` 에 "
"있고 전달된 폴더는 ''<destination>/<folder_name>/... `` 아래에 구조를 유지합니다. 인수를 생략하면 "
"대상은 기본 `` file_transfer_dir `` 에 쓸 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:458
#: f6697695e9ef4e3694fa9046e41578e0
msgid "The data path reuses the protocol's own transfer machinery:"
msgstr "데이터 경로는 프로토콜의 자체 전송 메커니즘을 재사용합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:461
#: 6ee037f0e4024d2988fcb2ccf3deef70
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The forwarding client streams the file with the standard file-transfer "
"byte stream (metadata header + ``file_transfer_chunk_len``-byte chunks, "
"default 65536) to a transfer socket on the server."
msgstr ""
"전달 클라이언트는 표준 파일 전송 바이트 스트림(메타데이터 헤더 + 64KiB 청크)을 사용하여 파일을 서버의 전송 소켓으로 "
"스트리밍합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:467
#: 43c94e746a5c46748846d0dc18a4e0ff
msgid ""
"The server acts as a pure relay: it reads the stream into per-target "
"memory queues and writes each chunk to every target's transfer socket. "
"The server never parses the file contents beyond the size header and "
"never writes to disk."
msgstr ""
"서버는 순수 릴레이 역할을 합니다. 즉, 스트림을 대상별 메모리 대기열로 읽고 각 청크를 모든 대상의 전송 소켓에 씁니다. 서버는 "
"크기 헤더를 초과하는 파일 내용을 구문 분석하지 않으며 디스크에 쓰지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:474
#: 9dec57916af34e109bee7ce1e0bae2d4
msgid ""
"Every target client receives the stream with the ordinary receive path "
"(``file_transfer_mode_recv``) and writes it to its own local disk, "
"exactly as if the server had pushed the file directly."
msgstr ""
"모든 대상 클라이언트는 일반 수신 경로(``file_transfer_mode_recv``)로 스트림을 수신하고 서버가 파일을 직접 "
"푸시한 것처럼 이를 자체 로컬 디스크에 씁니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:480
#: a095abaf821e41a6a66adbb776bc35ef
msgid "### Memory Bounding and Flow Control"
msgstr "### 메모리 경계 및 흐름 제어"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:482
#: 244214dd675345f8a72b1088ad99fea0
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Because uploader, server and targets may have different bandwidths, data "
"can pile up in the server's memory. ``TCP_Server_Base`` takes a "
"``max_mem_buff`` parameter (in MiB, default 2048, i.e. 2 GB) that bounds "
"the memory the forwarding machinery may hold in that process. When the "
"server's buffered bytes exceed ``max_mem_buff`` it sends ``/pause_trans``"
" to the forwarding client, which stops reading the source file; once the "
"writers drain the buffers below the low-water mark (half the limit) the "
"server sends ``/start_trans`` and the upload resumes. Receiving clients "
"drain each chunk to disk synchronously, so their buffered memory stays "
"bounded by a single chunk; the ``/pause_trans``/``/start_trans`` handlers"
" exist on both sides so any side can throttle a transfer when it buffers "
"data."
msgstr ""
"업로더, 서버, 대상의 대역폭이 다를 수 있으므로 서버의 메모리에 데이터가 쌓일 수 있습니다. ``TCP_Server_Base``와"
" ``TCP_Client_Base`` 모두 해당 프로세스에서 포워딩 장치가 보유할 수 있는 메모리를 제한하는 "
"``max_mem_buff`` 매개변수(MB 단위, 기본값은 2048, 즉 2GB)를 사용합니다. 서버의 버퍼링된 바이트가 "
"``max_mem_buff``를 초과하면 전달 클라이언트에 ``/pause_trans``를 보내고 소스 파일 읽기를 중지합니다. "
"작성자가 최저 수위 표시(제한의 절반) 아래로 버퍼를 배출하면 서버는 ``/start_trans``를 보내고 업로드가 재개됩니다. "
"수신 클라이언트는 각 청크를 디스크로 동기식으로 배출하므로 버퍼링된 메모리는 단일 청크로 제한됩니다. "
"``/pause_trans``/``/start_trans`` 핸들러는 양쪽에 존재하므로 어느 쪽이든 데이터를 버퍼링할 때 전송을 "
"조절할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:506
#: 0aa14deaf6474437b421a65e21fce7d8
msgid "Concurrency and Threading"
msgstr "동시성과 스레딩"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:508
#: 825c5e1a8b9b405c967ca49a1861e258
msgid ""
"Both the server and the client use multiple levels of concurrency control"
" to ensure stability during file transfers."
msgstr "서버와 클라이언트 모두 여러 수준의 동시성 제어를 사용하여 파일 전송 중 안정성을 보장합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:512
#: 0d48b1245cd54597928cfc28d5b3c248
msgid "### File Transfer Semaphore"
msgstr "### 파일 전송 세마포어"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:514
#: e2674ee9e0584513bc53aa815603fd24
msgid "Client: ``self.file_semaphore = threading.Semaphore(max_thread_num)``"
msgstr "클라이언트: ``self.file_semaphore = threading.Semaphore(max_thread_num)``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:516
#: 1c0d27d13ad844159d29c6e662d51d09
msgid ""
"Server: ``self.file_semaphore = "
"threading.Semaphore(max_file_transfer_thread_num)``"
msgstr ""
"서버: ``self.file_semaphore = "
"threading.Semaphore(max_file_transfer_thread_num)``"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:519
#: cb65901904c8411ba53fc629023f732d
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This semaphore limits the number of simultaneous file transfers (used "
"primarily when sending folders or multiple files). Each transfer runs in "
"its own thread and the worker acquires the semaphore for the whole "
"transfer, so both the folder and the ``/multiple_file`` path are capped "
"at ``max_thread_num`` (``max_file_transfer_thread_num`` on the server)."
msgstr ""
"이 세마포어는 동시 파일 전송 수를 제한합니다(폴더 또는 여러 파일을 보낼 때 주로 사용됨). 각 전송은 자체 스레드에서 실행되며 "
"스레드가 시작되기 전에 세마포어를 획득합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:526
#: 6d93783b298e4ce98b999ff890d4a5f4
msgid "### Threading Model"
msgstr "### 스레딩 모델"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:528
#: 036a972600e645119d8a523fa08a52db
msgid ""
"Each file transfer runs in a dedicated daemon thread, created by the "
"``_thread`` wrapper functions (e.g., "
"``file_transfer_client_recv_client_start_thread``). This prevents a slow "
"transfer from blocking the main control loop."
msgstr ""
"각 파일 전송은 ``_thread`` 래퍼 함수(예: "
"``file_transfer_client_recv_client_start_thread``)에 의해 생성된 전용 데몬 스레드에서 "
"실행됩니다. 이는 느린 전송으로 인해 주 제어 루프가 차단되는 것을 방지합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:534
#: a84aaf5f9fb64d92b97c32185a1e7cb5
msgid ""
"The thread that receives the transfer command (e.g., the server's "
"``handle_command`` thread) does not wait for the transfer to complete; it"
" returns immediately after spawning the worker thread."
msgstr ""
"전송 명령을 받는 스레드(예: 서버의 ``handle_command`` 스레드)는 전송이 완료될 때까지 기다리지 않습니다. 작업자 "
"스레드를 생성한 후 즉시 반환됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:539
#: 669fb6da8e7444dd829a6e14295648b1
msgid ""
"The low-level receive function (``file_transfer_mode_recv``) blocks while"
" reading from the transfer socket, but because it runs in a dedicated "
"thread, the main connection remains responsive."
msgstr ""
"낮은 수준의 수신 기능(``file_transfer_mode_recv``)은 전송 소켓에서 읽는 동안 차단되지만 전용 스레드에서 "
"실행되기 때문에 기본 연결은 계속 응답합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:545
#: e39f8ae06ae84a6b84de8a3008ca17cb
msgid "### Thread Pool for Custom Commands"
msgstr "### 사용자 정의 명령을 위한 스레드 풀"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:547
#: 3ad49853529d4563bacdfb4ca6eee115
msgid ""
"Both classes also provide a ``ThreadPoolExecutor`` "
"(``self._custom_executor``) for custom command handlers. When a handler "
"is registered with ``run_in_thread=True``, it is submitted to this pool "
"via ``submit_task``, which also uses a semaphore to limit concurrency to "
"``max_custom_workers``. This mechanism is **independent** of the file "
"transfer semaphore and is intended for general-purpose command "
"processing."
msgstr ""
"두 클래스 모두 사용자 정의 명령 처리기를 위한 "
"``ThreadPoolExecutor``(``self._custom_executor``)도 제공합니다. 핸들러가 "
"``run_in_thread=True``로 등록되면 ``submit_task``를 통해 이 풀에 제출됩니다. 이 풀은 동시성을 "
"``max_custom_workers``로 제한하기 위해 세마포어도 사용합니다. 이 메커니즘은 파일 전송 세마포어와 "
"**독립적**이며 범용 명령 처리를 위한 것입니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:562
#: 1862d74da28a40219f82cfd7af89c126
msgid "Port Allocation and Management"
msgstr "포트 할당 및 관리"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:564
#: bd53ec8aa4ef498aa0815db16ed03140
msgid ""
"File transfers require ephemeral ports for the secondary data "
"connections. The ``palloc()`` and ``pfree()`` methods are used to obtain "
"and release these ports. Two modes are available:"
msgstr ""
"파일 전송에는 보조 데이터 연결을 위한 임시 포트가 필요합니다. ``palloc()`` 및 ``pfree()`` 메소드는 이러한 "
"포트를 획득하고 해제하는 데 사용됩니다. 두 가지 모드를 사용할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:570
#: eeaa9379d7d941159ac34f30ff6bb5f9
msgid ""
"**Automatic mode** (``is_hand_alloc_port=False``): ``palloc()`` returns "
"``0``, and the operating system assigns a free port when the socket is "
"bound. This is the recommended mode for most use cases."
msgstr ""
"**자동 모드** (``is_hand_alloc_port=False``): ``palloc()``은 ``0``을 반환하고, 소켓이 "
"바인딩될 때 운영 체제는 사용 가능한 포트를 할당합니다. 이는 대부분의 사용 사례에 권장되는 모드입니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:575
#: e3dc324e81734bd4bc768174caf200bf
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Manual mode** (``is_hand_alloc_port=True`` on the server constructor; "
"on the client the flag is set by the server's "
"``/client_alloc_port_range`` message): Ports are drawn from a "
"configurable range ``[self.min_port, self.max_port]`` with a step size "
"``port_add_step``. The server sends the allowed range to each client that"
" connects via ``/client_alloc_port_range``, and clients then use the same"
" manual allocation logic. See :doc:`../Port_Allocation/Port_Allocation` "
"for the range record and the retry behaviour."
msgstr ""
"**수동 모드** (``is_hand_alloc_port=True``): 포트는 단계 크기 ``port_add_step``으로 구성"
" 가능한 범위 ``[self.min_port, self.max_port]``에서 그려집니다. 서버는 "
"``/client_alloc_port_range``를 통해 허용 범위를 클라이언트에 브로드캐스트하고 클라이언트는 동일한 수동 할당 "
"논리를 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:590
#: 29cfdab183eb4f9f83de41ef62a60785
msgid ""
"*Note: For more details about port allocation, please visit the Port "
"Allocation API sections in :doc:`TCP_Server_APIs` and "
":doc:`TCP_Client_APIs`.*"
msgstr ""
"*참고: 포트 할당에 대한 자세한 내용은 :doc:`TCP_Server_APIs` 및 :doc:`TCP_Client_APIs`의 "
"포트 할당 API 섹션을 참조하세요.*"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:598
#: 189736d8d1f8464b8d301f219700fda4
msgid "Error Handling and Timeouts"
msgstr "오류 처리 및 시간 초과"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:600
#: bcc373777989436f9df3657446d1a7f2
msgid "### Timeout Values"
msgstr "### 시간 초과 값"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:602
#: 27d75d097a804ec28ebec5c67469c9c6
msgid ""
"**Start signal timeout**: 10 seconds. If the receiver does not send "
"``server_start_file_transfer_sign`` within this time, the sender aborts."
msgstr ""
"**시작 신호 시간 초과**: 10초. 수신자가 이 시간 내에 ``server_start_file_transfer_sign``을 "
"보내지 않으면 발신자가 중단됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:606
#: 93e877c411eb4c96bd7861ff61f35e7a
msgid ""
"**Port negotiation timeout**: 20 seconds. The initiator waits for the "
"peer's ``/server_file_transfer_port`` response."
msgstr "**포트 협상 시간 초과**: 20초. 개시자는 피어의 ``/server_file_transfer_port`` 응답을 기다립니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:609
#: 9e1d395bb59540a49393bebe6630e5eb
msgid ""
"**Completion acknowledgement timeout**: ``30 + (file_size // (100 * 1024 "
"* 1024)) * 10`` seconds. Larger files get proportionally more time."
msgstr ""
"**완료 확인 시간 초과**: ``30 + (file_size // (100 * 1024 * 1024)) * 10``초. 파일이 "
"클수록 비례적으로 더 많은 시간이 소요됩니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:613
#: 6b4e6135669b41178fdbb47ea5975381
msgid "### Error Signalling"
msgstr "### 오류 신호"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:615
#: 448fdc6ba3dd4d9eae925e7e241f8cb8
msgid ""
"Any error during the handshake or data transfer causes the failing side "
"to send ``error_sign`` over the transfer socket."
msgstr "핸드셰이크나 데이터 전송 중 오류가 발생하면 실패한 쪽에서 전송 소켓을 통해 ``error_sign``을 보냅니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:618
#: 5b4c23a93e984ce0af2e43cf4752225b
msgid ""
"The other side, upon receiving the error sign, closes the transfer socket"
" and aborts the transfer."
msgstr "상대방은 오류 신호를 받으면 전송 소켓을 닫고 전송을 중단합니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:621
#: b337a2726ded4d619c5e8026bef3f6ea
msgid ""
"The main control connection remains unaffected; only the transfer socket "
"is closed."
msgstr "메인 제어 연결은 영향을 받지 않습니다. 전송 소켓만 닫혀 있습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:625
#: 68be52c8e5ce447a9c5ec51a661229cf
msgid "### Exception Handling"
msgstr "### 예외 처리"

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:627
#: 036db9bc1858417ca589816028b83f80
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"All socket operations are wrapped in try-except blocks. When an exception"
" occurs (e.g., connection reset, file not found), the error is logged "
"through the instance's ``_log_exc`` helper, which prints the traceback "
"only when both ``is_print_log`` and ``is_debug`` are true, and the "
"transfer is aborted gracefully. The ``error_sign`` is sent if possible, "
"and the transfer socket is closed."
msgstr ""
"모든 소켓 작업은 try-Exception 블록으로 래핑됩니다. 예외가 발생하면(예: 연결 재설정, 파일을 찾을 수 없음) "
"``traceback.print_exc()``를 사용하여 오류가 기록되고 전송이 정상적으로 중단됩니다. 가능한 경우 "
"``error_sign``을 전송하고 전송 소켓을 닫습니다."

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:640
#: ba1f05134dd24afa9867881cc45ed14a
msgid "Transfer Progress and Network Speed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:642
#: 5c7b182bb5214dd2ad49e5b171876e95
msgid "Both classes record every running file transfer:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:644
#: 8adbb686d9b04c97b5a7314ec4a5d1fd
msgid "``file_recv_progress`` — the files being received (downloads);"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:645
#: 3d2d981185624b5498121d82b12d44ba
msgid "``file_upload_progress`` — the files being sent (uploads)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:647
#: e59132f2790d4b4fb2aa707e1d3b43b6
msgid ""
"The keys are the transfers' fids: the transfer id the sender stamps on "
"the transfer command (``/file <path> <id>``), which also identifies the "
"relay leg of a forwarded file. The protocol-internal public-key push is "
"not tracked. Each value is a five-item list:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:652
#: bf66e7dae7e24cf3a3687ffd30f547ec
msgid "``[0]``: bytes transferred so far;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:653
#: 2652aa8074764124b520d4e84b7667d5
msgid "``[1]``: total size of the file, in bytes;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:654
#: 8b09fc93700d4b6ca7a517700649c289
msgid ""
"``[2]``: the current network speed of that direction — ``None`` until the"
" transfer has moved its first chunk, and while "
"``is_enable_real_time_network_speed`` is ``False``;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:657
#: 311adcc13bd441a985ebcd8c775b152f
msgid ""
"``[3]``: local path of the file: the source of an outbound transfer, the "
"file being written for an inbound one;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:659
#: 7a1f875aeb8b497ab7785620e402ff97
msgid ""
"``[4]``: the ``(ip, port)`` of the transfer's original peer — the sender "
"in a download's entry, the receiver in an upload's. A forwarded transfer "
"stores the original peer on both sides, never the relaying server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:663
#: da38fbed94114f10b6f7366e43906dd8
msgid ""
"An entry appears when a transfer starts and is removed when it ends, so "
"the stores hold exactly the transfers that are in flight at that moment "
"(iterate over a copy while transfers are running). With "
"``is_enable_file_transfer_progress_bar`` set to ``False`` no entry is "
"ever recorded — and, since the stores are the state a reconnect resumes "
"from, no transfer can be resumed either."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:670
#: edbdd37cf5a04d42bf01f6bff5aa3307
msgid ""
"``is_enable_real_time_network_speed`` (``True`` by default) measures the "
"protocol's current traffic — the control layer and every temporary "
"connection, file transfers included — into ``upload_network_speed`` and "
"``recv_network_speed`` (bytes per second, a rolling average over "
"``NETWORK_SPEED_WINDOW`` seconds). With the flag ``False`` nothing is "
"sampled and every speed value is ``None``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:677
#: c60e3cb78c8d48faace7569bdb50f8f5
msgid ""
"The web tool (``transfer_web``) reads these stores: both backends serve "
"``/api/transfers`` (the rows plus the two speed attributes), and the "
"shared frontend renders the live speed readout in the topbar and one "
"progress bar per running transfer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:685
#: ce90e0b6082e4d37a79346aa7b2763f9
msgid "Pausing, Reconnecting and Resuming Transfers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:687
#: 5fbf414617474bd79978360043f149a3
msgid ""
"An outbound transfer can be held and released at any time with the "
"``pause_trans(fid)`` and ``start_trans(fid)`` methods (both classes), or "
"from the peer with the ``/pause_trans <fid>`` and ``/start_trans <fid>`` "
"lines: ``pause_trans_remote(peer, fid)``/``start_trans_remote(peer, "
"fid)`` send them. The leg stops before its next chunk and stays open; a "
"leg that is paused keeps its socket, so nothing is torn down. Every "
"outbound transfer honours its own fid — a plain upload as much as the "
"upload leg of a forwarded file — so the flow control the server uses on a"
" relay works on any transfer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:696
#: d4ace80bc05f4bafb8144e1de31060dc
msgid "The temporary connections of a transfer are resumed after a disconnect:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:698
#: d7d49609832d4c5bb2d7cecb059805eb
msgid ""
"when a connection drops, both sides write their transfer stores to "
"``.Flow/server_file_trans_progress.json`` / "
"``.Flow/client_file_trans_progress.json`` (the "
"``file_trans_progress_file`` attribute) — every upload, every download "
"and, on the server, the relay records a disconnected forward is re-driven"
" from;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:703
#: 353cf50d60014cceb4c5a36bf5b98b83
msgid ""
"an interrupted transfer keeps its progress entry and its partial file "
"instead of dropping them, so the file on disk is exactly the state to "
"continue from;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:706
#: c7017b370d4147128e54a94458a7b536
msgid ""
"after a reconnect the receiver drives the resume (`resume_transfers`): it"
" opens a fresh transfer listener, announces it and sends ``/resume_trans "
"<fid> <offset>`` with the byte offset its partial file holds. The sender "
"re-establishes the leg, reads its source from that offset and only the "
"remainder of the file travels. A forwarded transfer is asked for through "
"the server, which routes ``/forward_resume`` to the originating client so"
" it re-forwards just the missing part."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/File_Transfer/File_Transfer.rst:714
#: ee858a76e93f44d5934cb2d89f6709a5
msgid ""
"The server resumes a peer's transfers when it reconnects, and a client "
"with ``is_auto_reconnect=True`` reconnects on its own and resumes every "
"transfer it can reach; `resume_transfers` is public, so an application "
"can also drive the resume itself. Legs the previous session left behind "
"are closed before the resume runs, so two legs never write the same "
"transfer."
msgstr ""

